<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37651" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξουσ-ιάζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.):—<i>exercise authority,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>have power,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.6S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>exercise authority over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μνήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					4584
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					22.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἑαυτῆς ἕδνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					15.170
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸν λαόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ne.</u>
					5.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				8.9
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be held under authority,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				6.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>enjoy licence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1216a2
			</span></i>.</div>
